###Request
POST https://testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/orderdata/scv/orders/by-flight-date HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.pnr == 'ANYDAY')]
$[?(@.flightDate)]
$[?(@.firstName == 'Jane')]
$[?(@.lastName == 'Doe')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

[{"id":"ORDER-ANYDAY"}]
